{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pioneer 3D fighting series continues to evolve as Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage arrives on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage takes the gameplay of Virtua Fighter 5 to new heights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rollback Netcode and Cross-play support let you take on any challenger, anywhere, across the globe in the most intense battles yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A brand-new single-player mode, &quot;World Stage&quot;: Challenge powerful rivals on a solo quest to become the ultimate fighter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enhanced replay functionality and improved training tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This product contains only the base game. A bundle including the base game and additional content is also available. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're ten years too early!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/2e773f2c343fafc8f899e895a850b4bca72eeb41.jpg"},{"name":"You are nowhere near ready to face the master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/795523566ac4a91c2ee7ce222a665d6b05977b11.jpg"},{"name":"There's no way anyone can stop me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/ac089fac942ca5b70770f9cf02efc8f8ca2d3f32.jpg"},{"name":"I won!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/767e1e495e569d19d00a2a3fa3cbc3262b9bfb66.jpg"},{"name":"I'll show you\u2026 the results of my training!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/3cd9edc12a3ace96c55e249726ad7394728e79fe.jpg"},{"name":"Here I come!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/ff1fe2807b59a21f6fd984e06afb8300a888127d.jpg"},{"name":"Do you hear me!? I'm the best that's ever been!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/5639bf15264fb01a69e8dbfd13080dad927af7df.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/557ce1436b64cd13462915622566117a208aeae8.jpg"},{"name":"I won't lose!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/170d783d26b7ed760341a6d7ef7272f2adf3a614.jpg"},{"name":"Hmm, maybe I should hold back next time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3112260/a7dc7012ff768680ee46fa0733f5353bbd776daa.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3112260?t=1769739453","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112260/d3ba76f80611646f8869687ad5dd9ed883c4527a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769739453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112260/26ef867c539479649b9fcc9217d3f7521d59dc02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769739453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112260/26ef867c539479649b9fcc9217d3f7521d59dc02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769739453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage 30th Anniversary Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112260/extras/db248b4810370130cab46b6a9d94c000.avif?t=1769739453\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage arrives on Steam! Celebrate the 30th anniversary of the first 3D fighting series with this special edition packed with exclusive content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-VF 30th Anniversary Swimsuit Costume Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-VF 30th Anniversary Soundtrack Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-VF 30th Anniversary Pre-Production Artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Virtua Fighter Legendary Pack DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u201cYakuza\u201d Series Collaboration Pack DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30th Anniversary Edition Ranking Titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30th Anniversary Wallpaper Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage continues to evolve to new heights with new features including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rollback Netcode and Cross-play support let you take on any challenger, anywhere, across the globe in the most intense battles yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A brand-new single-player mode, &quot;World Stage&quot;: Challenge powerful rivals on a solo quest to become the ultimate fighter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enhanced replay functionality and improved training tools.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pioneer 3D fighting series continues to evolve as Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage arrives on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtua Fighter 5 R.E.V.O. World Stage takes the gameplay of Virtua Fighter 5 to new heights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rollback Netcode and Cross-play support let you take on any challenger, anywhere, across the globe in the most intense battles yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A brand-new single-player mode, &quot;World Stage&quot;: Challenge powerful rivals on a solo quest to become the ultimate fighter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enhanced replay functionality and improved training tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This product contains only the base game. A bundle including the base game and additional content is also available. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases.</p>","developers":["Ryu Ga Gotoku Studio"],"dlc":[3761410,3282770,3282760,3282780],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112260/9501a2ea86226e8620f07dd889e1c365e2d32e66/header.jpg?t=1769739453","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9SEGA","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3112260/1465085962/90caff430df9dfe19c5878e4723fbe731f4d38df/1763563662/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763693828","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3112260/1465085962/90caff430df9dfe19c5878e4723fbe731f4d38df/1763563662/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763693828","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3112260/1465085962/90caff430df9dfe19c5878e4723fbe731f4d38df/1763563662/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763693828","id":257234516,"name":"VF5 REVO World Stage Launch Trailer Unrated v2 (EN)","thumbnai